{"path":"biology/experiments/lab/plasmolysis","title":"质壁分离实验（失水复原方向判断）","type":"example","html":"<p>下列关于&quot;观察植物细胞的质壁分离及复原&quot;实验的叙述，<strong>错误</strong>的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 应选择有大液泡的活细胞作为实验材料</p>\n<p>B. 滴加 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3\\,\\text{g/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/mL</span></span></span></span></span> 蔗糖溶液后，液泡逐渐变小，颜色变深</p>\n<p>C. 质壁分离复原过程中，细胞的吸水能力逐渐增强</p>\n<p>D. 若改用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\,\\text{g/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/mL</span></span></span></span></span> 蔗糖溶液，可能观察不到复原现象</p>\n<ul>\n<li>质壁分离本质：外界溶液浓度 &gt; 细胞液浓度 → 细胞失水 → 原生质层与细胞壁分离；</li>\n<li>高频变式：加的是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">KNO_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 溶液——<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NO_3^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 能主动运输进入细胞，<strong>自动复原</strong>（先质壁分离后自动复原，经典现象）；</li>\n<li>选材细节：紫色洋葱<strong>外表皮</strong>（有紫色大液泡便于观察）；若用内表皮需染色；</li>\n<li>实验流程：制片 → 低倍镜观察正常细胞 → 滴蔗糖 → 观察质壁分离 → 滴清水 → 观察复原——&quot;先低倍后高倍、先蔗糖后清水&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>A</strong>：质壁分离的条件：活细胞 + 大液泡 + 细胞壁与原生质层伸缩性不同——洋葱鳞片叶<strong>外表皮</strong>符合 ✓。</p>\n<p><strong>B</strong>：外界蔗糖浓度高于细胞液 → 细胞失水 → 液泡变小、细胞液浓度增大、色素变浓（颜色变深）✓。</p>\n<p><strong>C</strong>：复原过程 = 细胞吸水，细胞液被稀释、浓度<strong>逐渐减小</strong> → 吸水能力<strong>逐渐减弱</strong>。说&quot;逐渐增强&quot; ✘。</p>\n<p><strong>D</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\,\\text{g/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/mL</span></span></span></span></span> 蔗糖浓度过高，细胞过度失水死亡，原生质层失去选择透过性，不能复原 ✓。</p>\n<p>选 <strong>C</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：失水/复原现象判断 → <strong>&quot;浓度方向口诀&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>失水：液泡小、颜色深、浓度大、吸水强；复原全反。</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>滴蔗糖 → 失水 → 液泡变小颜色变深（B ✓）；</li>\n<li>复原 → 吸水 → 浓度<strong>变小</strong> → 吸水能力<strong>变弱</strong>——C 说&quot;增强&quot;必错；</li>\n<li>浓度过高（0.5 g/mL）→ 失水过多死亡 → 不复原（D ✓）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>20 秒锁定 C</strong>，四个选项一句话全覆盖。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"下列关于&quot;观察植物细胞的质壁分离及复原&quot;实验的叙述， 错误 的是（ ） A. 应选择有大液泡的活细胞作为实验材料 B. 滴加 0.3 g/mL 0.3\\,\\text{g/mL} 0.3 g/mL 蔗糖溶液后，液泡逐渐变小","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"中档","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"判断\"吸水能力\"要看细胞液浓度变化方向：失水时浓度增大、吸水能力增强；复原时相反。0.5 g/mL 蔗糖会使细胞过度失水死亡，无法复原。","fit":["质壁分离及复原实验的叙述判断","选材/操作/现象/结论","选填题"],"updated":"Wed Feb 12 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"实验与探究"},{"slug":"lab","title":"实验与探究"},{"slug":"plasmolysis","title":"质壁分离实验（失水复原方向判断）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"alcohol-test","title":"酒精检验（酸性重铬酸钾）","type":"example"},{"slug":"control-types","title":"三种对照方法辨析（空白/自身/相互）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-full","title":"实验设计全流程（三变量法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"教材实验与实验设计","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"mitosis-observe","title":"观察根尖有丝分裂·实验流程与现象","type":"example"},{"slug":"pigment-extraction","title":"绿叶中色素的提取和分离","type":"example"}]}